Provenance of the artifacts beside this file.
=============================================

These are not a stand-in. They are the verbatim output of one live run of
S1 ingest -> S2 synthesize -> S3 annotate -> S4 validate -> S5 register against
a real model producer, recorded so the rest of the path can be replayed without
one. `spikes/end_to_end.sh` replays them by default and re-runs S4 and S5 over
them for real; `E2E_MODEL=1` calls the producer again instead.

  date        2026-08-14
  requirement spikes/e2e/requirement.txt (unchanged since)
  producer    spikes/e2e/producer.sh -> `claude -p` (Claude Code CLI 2.1.229)
  model       self-reported by the CLI; not independently verified
  prompts     orbweaver_forge::{ingest::S1_PROMPT, synthesize::S2_PROMPT,
              annotate::S3_PROMPT}, passed through FORGE_PROMPT
  command     forge-pipeline --requirements <dir> --ingest <w> --synthesize <w>
                             --annotate <w> --out <dir> --max-rounds 3 --register
  exit        0
  wall        about 2 min for 3 sequential model calls and no repair rounds

